^[chapter/08/sections][
  s01: <
    handle: "custom-boof/01"
    type: "custom-boof"
    excerpt: "The Watering Eye was a well before it was a witness, and a witness long before anyone built a tavern leaning over it like a drinker over a confession. Boof came in under the sagging floorboards and set her front paws ..."
