  s02: <
    handle: "custom-game/02"
    type: "custom-game"
    excerpt: "All night the Genie dealt in wants. Name one, hear the price, pay or fold. An empire? Quite manageable; the world was forever tipping toward a throne. Supper everyone agreed on? He counted the company twice and quoted..."
